    affectedAreas: ["Superheater and evaporator steam-generator modules (sodium boiler building)", "Secondary-sodium system, surge tank and secondary piping", "Intermediate heat exchanger tubes and the primary/secondary boundary", "Sodium pressure-relief / rupture-disk path and the hydrogen-meter leak-detection system"],
