    analysisMethods: ["NFPA 69 (combustible-gas / explosion prevention, inerting) and NFPA 68 (deflagration venting)", "Hydrogen deflagration / deflagration-to-detonation combustion analysis (lumped-parameter and CFD)", "CONTAIN-LMR / MELCOR-sodium hydrogen-generation and combustion modeling", "Regulatory Guide 1.7 / 10 CFR 50.44-style combustible-gas-control evaluation adapted for SFR sodium chemistry", "Cover-gas-system pressure-control and inert-blanket reliability analysis"],
